":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- 2d3bdcac35ac22ee6c4d5d5edc88ba947d0659d5 - reproducible\n- 4.4.1 - Not reproducible\n\n### System information\n\nArch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 10 Apr 2025 18:43:59 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Single-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 6900 XT (radeonsi, navi21, LLVM 19.1.7, DRM 3.61, 6.14.2-arch1-1) - AMD Ryzen 9 5950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nDuplicating AcceptDialog/ConfirmationDialog nodes with children will yield the following message:\n\n```\nERROR: Index p_index = 0 is out of bounds ((int)data.children_cache.size() - data.internal_children_front_count_cache - data.internal_children_back_count_cache = 0).\n   at: get_child (scene/main/node.cpp:1946)\nERROR: Child node disappeared while duplicating.\n   at: _duplicate_properties (scene/main/node.cpp:3194)\n```\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open MRP's main scene.\n- Click on the node named \"DuplicateBugsOutHere\" and press Ctrl-D to generate the error message shown previously.\n- Changing the type of this node to AcceptDialog and attempting to duplicate will yield the same error.\n- Curiously, after changing the type of this node to Window, duplicate works normally but only under that type.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[DuplicateNodeBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19826373/DuplicateNodeBug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aki